<title>UK: BBC sees Labour majority of 171 after 13 results.</title>
<headline>BBC sees Labour majority of 171 after 13 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first 13 results in the British election suggest an average swing to Labour of 8.9 percent, the BBC said.</p>
<p>If this swing is replicated across the country, Labour will form the next government with a majority of around 171 seats, it said.</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
